Lock-step runs (PORTAGE_STAGE5_VERIFY=1: every reused attempt rebuilt and compared,
every merge list that is put off computed on the spot) on the six states with 0035
alone, 0036 alone and all three: no difference.

Known differences from unpatched head that do not touch the merge list: as in
../ladder-73646c35d/README (testFindAtomForPackage, one "Manifest not found" line).

